From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 07:00:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Isolate stalled threaded WAL Home notifications

Reserve bounded notification capacity per shipper. Keep write acknowledgements independent of Home inboxes and preserve the order of open results, breaks and close requests.

Publish saturation to routing for new trees. Report registration races before execution and return inbox capacity on unregister and teardown.

